This product includes behaviour adapted from prodex
(https://github.com/christiandoxa/prodex), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). mycodex is an
independent Python implementation and contains no prodex source code. The
following were adapted from prodex 0.435.1:

  * the list of Codex home entries shared between account homes
    (src/mycodex/profiles.py);
  * the classification of backend errors into quota, rate-limit,
    deactivated-workspace, overload and transient classes, including the error
    codes and usage-limit phrases it recognises (src/mycodex/proxy.py);
  * the headers sent to ChatGPT's usage endpoint (src/mycodex/quota.py);
  * the terminal panel and table layout (src/mycodex/ui.py).

mycodex runs the official OpenAI Codex CLI (https://github.com/openai/codex,
Apache License 2.0) as a separate program and does not include its code.
